#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Phoinix_Base
#: liminal-union/units/phoinixes/a0-phoinix.cfg:60
msgid "The Phoinix is a living emblem of renewal and passage, said never to have bowed to corruption. Its presence is an affront to the forces of darkness and an uncomfortable reminder to those who would enthrone arcane will above the common law. A sealed core of vital radiance burns within, and a Phoinix's touch may draw poison from the wounded. The Liminal Union trains Phoinix Messengers as swift mobile scouts. A discerning Phoinix may be called forth by the old kabbalistic recitation of the corps; some choose to bind themselves to a particular singer-keeper. The Phoinix flies very high, beyond the reach of most enemy weapons, and holds no fixed ground — nor does its passage impose constraint upon enemy lines."
msgstr ""

